# Local credentials for the generation skills in .claude/skills/.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in — `.env` is gitignored; this template is not.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Loading: audiogen and imagegen2 each walk up from their own directory to the
# project root and load the first `.env` they find via Node's built-in
# process.loadEnvFile (no dotenv dependency). Note the precedence — a variable
# already exported in your shell WINS over the value here. Unset a stale shell
# export if this file appears to be ignored. Blank values are treated as unset.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# audiogen — music, voice, and sound effects.
# Key: https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
# Free tier (10K credits/month) covers everything the skill does; paid tiers
# drop the attribution requirement on generated output.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# imagegen2 — gpt-image-2 stills; also the image backend anim8gen drives,
# so anim8gen needs this key too and has no separate key of its own.
# OpenAI may require API Organization Verification before GPT Image models
# resolve; if generation is denied with a valid key, check the developer
# console first.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional — OpenAI routing. Only needed if your key must be scoped explicitly
# to one org or project. Leave blank otherwise; blank sends no header.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

OPENAI_ORGANIZATION=
OPENAI_PROJECT=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional — anim8gen layout overrides. Defaults shown; uncomment to change.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Hidden per-run working state (specs, candidate frames, review records).
#ANIM8GEN_WORKSPACE_ROOT=.anim8gen

# Visible finished assets — the sprites, GIFs, and previews you keep.
#ANIM8GEN_EXPORT_ROOT=assets/anim8gen

# Scratch space. Defaults to a per-project dir under the system temp dir.
#ANIM8GEN_TMPDIR=

# Also export unretouched raw generations beside the cleaned frames.
# Accepts 1/true/yes/on.
#ANIM8GEN_ALWAYS_EXPORT_RAW=
